{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_title", "source_sha256": "be8b332ebf351b61d165ff1542beebb5ea501ff06fd32c79132e08daa9c0c633", "ja": "おとぎばなしが叶うまで", "zh": "直到童话成真的那一天", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d5dfdf3be604722ae3b97123fe623daeb2c5314e31797da59e49b60f3074fe2a", "ja": "新曲をもらい張り切る桃子。だが桃子の様子\nが普段とすこし違う事に気づき、気にかける\nメンバー達。人に話せなかった悩みを志保、\nそしてプロデューサーに話した桃子は「アイ\nドル周防桃子」として公演を成功させる。", "zh": "拿到了新歌而干劲十足的桃子。但察觉\n到桃子和平时有些不一样的成员们，\n纷纷关心起她来。桃子向志保以及制作人\n倾诉了此前无法对人言说的烦恼，\n并作为“偶像周防桃子”成功完成了公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1000_null", "source_sha256": "e89577b1be83c7dd9ac4da7efa027d4fa55eac4cf61cbf1720de905d5b565b1c", "ja": "翌日、レッスン終了後……", "zh": "第二天，课程结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5b42a3fc99a535d0c4b8ad737ef3e40272e4a045b0f3bcd1374ea313ec8a0a5d", "ja": "（今日は日曜。レッスンは午前中で終わったが、\n桃子は今日も残っているみたいだ。話を聞いてみるか）", "zh": "（今天是星期天。虽然课程上午就结束了，但桃子今天好像也留了下来。要不要去问问她呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1002_se", "source_sha256": "c01f9901aa06ad650b314d5a929022d1574a5f17402b31fd5bd6359592e719d6", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4ab756da4096878b7723fc3a4ae8e448794fc8977af0587e46a73fd2b7de6d09", "ja": "お疲れさま、桃子。\n今日も残ってるんだな。", "zh": "辛苦了，桃子。\n今天也留下来了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "4f85dbc31765b6e8a3e4d6bd18f4edcc750bc76124fc84aa9bffa526a3ccf8aa", "ja": "あ、お兄ちゃん。お疲れさま。\nなに？　桃子が残ってたらいけない？", "zh": "啊，哥哥。辛苦了。\n怎么？桃子留下来不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5053f27a45344bc45e553397cc9052e83151676cf9e24de9a85ea2053c2cdbf9", "ja": "そうじゃないけど……\n最近、いつも残ってるんだって？", "zh": "不是那样，只是……\n听说你最近总是留到最后？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "75b1b876492979f542a86703c1174fdcebcb7021c1a2e710f1838f56a1de20fb", "ja": "も、もう……何言ってるの？　お兄ちゃん。\nそんなの公演前なんだから、当たり前でしょ。", "zh": "真、真是的……在说什么呀？大哥哥。\n公演之前加练，不是理所当然的事嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1007_p", "source_sha256": "51f7cbb80845e37abe6113774ed2e36a4f2a4e717e0e71a2e42f918ab98b981c", "ja": "けど、まだ本番まで2週間ある。レッスンだって、\nそんなに根を詰めるほど切羽詰まってないだろ？", "zh": "不过，距离正式演出还有2周。现在也还没紧张到连训练都要拼命赶进度吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "653d81b44c167110f380d9ff486fdc035f08fffedeaad4f3ba9218e1c3d1594c", "ja": "それはそうだけど……でも、桃子の新曲公演だもん。\n完璧にやりたいでしょ！", "zh": "话是这么说……可这是桃子的全新歌曲公演。桃子也想做到完美吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1009_p", "source_sha256": "dc42e21c5a4befaac88b2a120983b8e7dadd0888dedb7ea1077fb7b1e56935e9", "ja": "完璧にやりたいなら、尚更きちんと管理しないと。\nそれとも、何か悩み事でもあるのか？", "zh": "正因为想做到完美，才更应该好好做好管理。\n还是说，你有什么烦心事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "d74f31890057b7751028f30725032cae69a70c312e7f52311cc782c17c737bc5", "ja": "うっ。そ、それは……。", "zh": "呃……那、那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1011_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "fef1fd50b572f1c7fdb1d3751d6bd8c48dac5ee97c7930d014858364e3cb5ca6", "ja": "お疲れさまです。\n……{$P$}。周防さんも。", "zh": "辛苦了。\n……{$P$}。周防小姐也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b41ce49a66add6934000c7d0c3d4c940de4763fa0689cc0901dc645be2a07394", "ja": "ふ、ふたりとも、どうかしたんですか？\nもしかして、ケンカ……？", "zh": "你、你们两位这是怎么了？\n难道是在吵架……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1014_p", "source_sha256": "93b154a3cc6b0baeb3dc1cdac78e4595ff68847681e0ff2596c188f9809262c0", "ja": "いや、ケンカじゃないんだが……ちょうどよかった。", "zh": "不，并不是吵架……你来得正好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f7200ee387d7287a51ff8a1ba5b34ad45ea28173fca14ae8c132b52ecd494dc6", "ja": "実は、桃子が何か悩みがあるみたいなんだけど、\n話してくれないんだ。", "zh": "其实，桃子好像有什么烦恼，\n但她不肯跟我说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "9d707d0f4bf9ee2bc7762ca83efa3a7895c10de4f87236bd0736a02879820d11", "ja": "ちょっと、お兄ちゃん！？", "zh": "等一下，大哥哥！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "2062a8d6552ef15183908ada46acd96da50c32cc0d5d11d8a47d957cfddc7008", "ja": "なんと。それは一大事です。\n周防さん、ぜひお話を聞かせてください。", "zh": "什么？那可真是不得了。\n周防小姐，请务必把事情告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0d0fc3d57b31378ddc35a9147f3fb61c0d113a7f6f46df9f68f21204c99d93f2", "ja": "公演まで、あと2週間しかないもんね……。\n桃子ちゃん、私たちで良ければ協力するよ！", "zh": "距离公演只剩下2周了嘛……桃子，如果我们能帮上忙的话，就让我们来帮你吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "7fd129c18496ddb9a9cf0eb4975b4e7035f957b14f810ac5256c859d34ab4098", "ja": "も、もう！\nだから、そういうことじゃなくて……。", "zh": "真、真是的！\n所以才不是那回事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "bc22f98ac50edfd5bd4fd213c42dd05573e32d702cfc5e467a4bea9ec6195ab3", "ja": "周防さん……悩み相談の相手、\n私ではダメでしょうか。しょんぼり。", "zh": "周防同学……作为商量烦恼的倾诉对象，\n我不可以吗。沮丧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1021_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b22ab371f9da5a19455539bd24700c10bd43510db6e96fe38fb255adcb0dea63", "ja": "瑞希ちゃんがそんなこと言ったら、私なんかじゃ、\nもっと頼りにならないかもしれないけど……うう。", "zh": "要是瑞希说出那种话，像我这样的人可能就更靠不住了……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1022_049mom", "source_sha256": "a686452b9d70cbcfc167b733d38b02504c5d4f16b18add4096ccc4da5e4da342", "ja": "そ、そんなことないよ！　ただ、えっと……桃子も、\nなんて言えばいいのかよくわからなくて……。", "zh": "才、才不是那样！只是，那个……桃子也不太清楚该怎么说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "94d6555866891b798d2b33369ed5ed42476b2d89a0660a6c438c4cc645d5ad04", "ja": "とにかく、この話はもうおしまい！\nそれじゃ、お疲れさまでした！", "zh": "总之，这件事就到此为止！\n那么，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1024_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ebe5d6cf73cf9a97480132c72d68c3cd7241d1e207a385ecf28e26c02fd46108", "ja": "あっ、桃子ちゃん！　……行っちゃいましたね。\nちょっと、しつこくしちゃったかなぁ……。", "zh": "啊，桃子！……已经走掉了呢。\n是不是有点缠得太紧了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1025_p", "source_sha256": "f189ee0f6ce1dacc21c1f9620edd901f3550e20a743825d9693ea03ea3217d47", "ja": "ふたりになら、俺に相談するよりは話しやすいかと\n思ったんだけど……巻き込んですまなかったな。", "zh": "我本来想着，要是你们两个人一起说，应该会比来找我商量更容易开口……结果把你也卷进来了，抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1026_004yuk", "source_sha256": "88ac143f0f5848cb3916e445c469244b9e7a8f9e1110f89e1ed6f0e47b53ca92", "ja": "いいえ。あの、相談ならいつでも乗りますから……\n桃子ちゃんに伝えておいてもらえますか？", "zh": "没事的。那个，随时都可以来找我商量……\n能不能帮我转告桃子一声呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1027_044miz", "source_sha256": "e8d36b9c886c602aa88361a70ad2d92faf90e39b11aeac46ad78e6ad8fe489f3", "ja": "私もです。うまく答えられるかは、\nわかりませんが……算数なら、得意ですから。", "zh": "我也是。虽然不知道能不能答得好……但数学的话，我很擅长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1028_p", "source_sha256": "bcdeb411c98a52013afa8d99790ea87570f69d9e023b2064fe8fdc9284caf0b7", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう。伝えておくよ！", "zh": "啊，谢谢。我会转告她的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1029_p", "source_sha256": "20eabdd2b3b56d121d5d19deb4c07036429917c9783b29b41e83f4cf4be1ea06", "ja": "（桃子が家に帰りたがらない理由。\n仲間にも話せない悩み。これは、やっぱり……）", "zh": "（桃子不想回家的理由。连同伴也无法诉说的烦恼。这果然是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1030_049mom", "source_sha256": "080997d542f31ab05b09d0fdfe3f017e80e18a801bf6afe06e7cee8ade006044", "ja": "はぁ……帰るって言って出てきちゃったけど、\nちょっと早いな。どこで時間つぶそう……。", "zh": "唉……虽然说着要回去就出来了，可现在回去还是有点早。去哪儿打发时间好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1031_049mom", "source_sha256": "9210493d23c1b1b75831ea01d354bdde4b9943cba088453acb0037a8cc4b838b", "ja": "あのまま控え室にいれば、宿題だってできたのに。\nそれもこれも、お兄ちゃんのせいなんだから！", "zh": "要是刚才一直待在休息室，还能写写作业呢。\n归根结底，全都是大哥哥的错啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1032_033sih", "source_sha256": "5259bc4fdbe8dd7f0137923301da1810e5ab7a59f57cd2534f61dc6b681eb212", "ja": "桃子？　……こんなところで何をしてるの。", "zh": "桃子？……你怎么会在这种地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1033_049mom", "source_sha256": "d23850d3d1d8bca4b477e136c73fc2c1ef7093b3cb1b2b803704c895c6196d4a", "ja": "あっ！　志保さん。\nあの、えっと……。", "zh": "啊！志保小姐。\n那个，呃……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1034_033sih", "source_sha256": "f9b9a7599a12fc436f1127e56e13cf7c27b71c79e30186aeb909ae5df26af5fb", "ja": "……家に帰りたくないの？", "zh": "……你不想回家吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1035_049mom", "source_sha256": "97c04bbf0fa5390c0211fa3e7a5754ef5d75852c24ba92405a8ced4326156bd5", "ja": "えっ？　……ど、どうして？", "zh": "咦？……为、为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1036_033sih", "source_sha256": "1b93d169402bd8961d03725fb0cef3d8a6d87f9422fdad5936461d22e661737b", "ja": "別に。……ただ私にも、そういう時はあったから。", "zh": "没什么……只是，我也有过那种时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1037_049mom", "source_sha256": "980749f3e1a574f4f91d8c18e0b3ad2f8e09e8c838a4e9252dd06fb0a573ab30", "ja": "そう……なの？", "zh": "这样……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1038_033sih", "source_sha256": "237f9d9000c4897e69ce25663e305639ba577a95cad09c87bf795f63ebac3f64", "ja": "ええ。特に、これって理由はないんだけど、\nなんだか家に居づらくて。", "zh": "嗯。虽然也没有特别的理由，但总觉得待在家里有点不自在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1039_049mom", "source_sha256": "70f624cf8dd8960d7ed1f8e76b6bc3cf0175ac5b3f9cc87f528f9e08bc4d1656", "ja": "あの……志保さん。\n聞いてもいい……？", "zh": "那个……志保小姐。\n我可以问一下吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1040_033sih", "source_sha256": "039e9eacfdff07c29e50d1ca99b268be0b7c794db6439c98a575b2e1a30ad43b", "ja": "何を？", "zh": "什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1041_049mom", "source_sha256": "9db14723a341955effe1a380a01dd6c4a2b6b3b8539124a2b489306d389f0015", "ja": "志保さんちって……お父さん、いないんだよね……？", "zh": "志保家里……没有父亲，对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1042_033sih", "source_sha256": "0274ea71dc3ebcaa41ac5592c721349222d20a8e597492e611d059248f8aef50", "ja": "……ええ。", "zh": "……是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1043_049mom", "source_sha256": "5bf9bbce1a252ba9a4538775ca35a8a10d1709c3b0ae7551f4ffc8e21ed17a5d", "ja": "知ってるかもだけど、うちはお父さんとお母さんが\nいないの。だからおばあちゃんと暮らしてるんだけど。", "zh": "你可能已经知道了，我家里没有爸爸和妈妈。所以我一直和奶奶住在一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1044_049mom", "source_sha256": "4dc8553846417a9f40e05d2f7d4e5c1c77679a5d66aedacae8a72cd836fa8474", "ja": "最近、お父さんとお母さんから連絡が来たんだ。\nどっちかと一緒に暮らさないかって……。", "zh": "最近，爸爸和妈妈联系我了。\n问我要不要跟其中一个人一起住……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1045_049mom", "source_sha256": "9f3afc0e29ffd62cb8f708d557e871aecaf39b8320e38cc7f671e96c9fc0678e", "ja": "でもね。でも……桃子は、どっちかじゃやなの。\nお父さんとお母さんと、3人でいっしょがいい……。", "zh": "可是……可是……桃子不想只和其中一个人一起。\n桃子想和爸爸、妈妈，还有3个人一起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1046_033sih", "source_sha256": "db517c38b1d799d36394090a958ad518558dd8425d63df1e1fb3fadb608d9ff1", "ja": "……そうよね。", "zh": "……是啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1047_049mom", "source_sha256": "351d7a8aad38db6a3357d800d0d88f26ae54f14b7e353f481a88594b1a4e37a9", "ja": "桃子、どうしたらいいのかわからなくて。\n……志保さんだったら、どうする？", "zh": "桃子不知道该怎么办。\n……如果是志保姐的话，会怎么做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1048_033sih", "source_sha256": "5dcc31cb1a6d731b937272021bf182ac4fcf9ef74fa8d5bb7c12a8173a5c7497", "ja": "私だったら……。", "zh": "要是我的话……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1050_033sih", "source_sha256": "6dfcb70904717fe4096eb5ceb5c3f30b2d9cb61dad06a9dbe60ff8864e193663", "ja": "ねえ、桃子。それって本当に、\n私やあなたが選ばなくちゃいけないことなの。", "zh": "喂，桃子。那件事，真的非得由我和你来选择不可吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1051_049mom", "source_sha256": "da6841588443793f957e937c23eecf1791aef726b02e802ddefd84355ebd4daf", "ja": "え……？　あの、どういう意味……。", "zh": "诶……？那个……是什么意思……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1052_p", "source_sha256": "b2c273c1a5094f55d437f8d73d79d927f198062593ed553558787706cdca745d", "ja": "あっ……桃子！　こんなところにいたのか。", "zh": "啊……桃子！原来你在这里啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1053_049mom", "source_sha256": "36c3affd40f2339379309fe8148a5357f9b23e3578eff4ea2f6b0188aa001bca", "ja": "あっ、お兄ちゃん。", "zh": "啊……哥哥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1054_033sih", "source_sha256": "7a7399358cbc495967c0e20e96a9486174ddbc0f37a66209efdc40ca2d777d1d", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ちょうど良かった。\n私たちの、相談に乗ってもらえますか。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，来得正好。\n能听听我们的烦恼，商量一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1055_049mom", "source_sha256": "26f57d1a835ac83843fafd4ba87c3061144a0904ac0fae1a7ca86abf7af92e1c", "ja": "し、志保さん！\n桃子が知りたいのは、志保さんの答えで……。", "zh": "志、志保姐！\n桃子想知道的是志保姐的答案……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1056_033sih", "source_sha256": "6370f26dc87fbe04ff1e0417b006dc3b0b8a5c9eae9d0528ab6da109a8b0ab26", "ja": "ええ。だからまずは、{$P$}さんに\n先に聞いてみたほうがいいかと思って。", "zh": "嗯。所以我觉得，还是先去问问{$P$}先生比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1057_033sih", "source_sha256": "bd911ec9caefa7402605a9448df2c5aaef99488efa915360158ed9804502f6ee", "ja": "その質問は、答える必要があるものなのかって。", "zh": "那个问题，有必要回答吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1058_049mom", "source_sha256": "17ec25dedc634e0c67362342c3994db6a7adf4220378439a633cec4d8c343378", "ja": "志保さん……？", "zh": "志保小姐……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1060_p", "source_sha256": "210490035d32dd7387727d154f2e7997b4fe14e61d90c88036f7ff0ebfd5248a", "ja": "なるほど、両親のどっちにつくか、か。\n確かに俺では、その質問には答えられないな。", "zh": "原来如此，是要选择站在父母哪一边吗？\n确实，这个问题我没法回答。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1062_p", "source_sha256": "fff8ce771a1b47bd3cc3bbb1d3309fa7aaf4170a67374edb6b91ac9703783e0b", "ja": "でも、そうだな。志保が言った「私達が答えるもの\nなのかどうか」なら、俺なりに答えられるよ。", "zh": "不过，这么说吧。关于志保说的“是不是该由我们来回答”\n这个问题，我可以用自己的方式回答。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1063_033sih", "source_sha256": "b6bff5e1795c8d1bf0f2e9fbda6942857efb18b3641a4984b71a0c4cc1ac3d01", "ja": "よかった。……じゃあ、あとは\n{$P$}さんにまかせますね。", "zh": "太好了。……那么，接下来就交给{$P$}先生了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1064_033sih", "source_sha256": "ddb18f29905713bcb9e4bd757d8d76e0d3cebce426f87967a0b842f5ca5fea0d", "ja": "桃子。私で良ければ、いつでも話は聞くから。\nじゃあ、また明日。", "zh": "桃子。如果你愿意，我随时都可以听你倾诉。\n那么，明天见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1065_049mom", "source_sha256": "b22b8321f2f8054f4ef0ae4289900b81cafedde2bdcf604313c3c3fc1713893a", "ja": "うん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1066_049mom", "source_sha256": "915fdf76cfc335236155b773dbfe7203dfb5990b33860b5a1f9b371eff0dcc63", "ja": "……お兄ちゃん。\n志保さんて、そっけないけど優しいね。", "zh": "……大哥哥。\n志保小姐虽然冷淡，但其实很温柔呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1067_p", "source_sha256": "f08af1b42a470af9ceb766f6168c313f4c3c832662ea580468adb7951c28eb9e", "ja": "ああ。志保がいてくれて助かった。\n……桃子。さっきは無神経な聞き方して、ごめんな。", "zh": "嗯。有志保在真是帮大忙了。\n……桃子，刚才问得太不顾及你的感受了，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1068_049mom", "source_sha256": "27373ff924691f20ed11cb92cc06726703dc30d4efe2feca32637d5962fb4fc6", "ja": "別に、お兄ちゃんのせいじゃないし。\n桃子が、なんて言えばいいかわからなかっただけ。", "zh": "不是哥哥的错。只是桃子不知道该说什么而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1069_049mom", "source_sha256": "6626bf2a54117cd1f275db0eb014ae81bf09e2fa03561270be9a4b987feb766a", "ja": "そういう……家の話とかされても、みんなだって\nなんて言っていいのかわからないでしょ。だから。", "zh": "就算说这种……家里的事，大家也都会不知道该说什么吧。所以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1070_049mom", "source_sha256": "474f3e35c3fc8e0c85620db5dcdf4eb7fb1a8fe85d0d0b1e58f003689e497b49", "ja": "志保さんは、桃子と近いみたいだったから。\nわかるかなって思ったんだけど……。", "zh": "志保小姐和桃子好像挺相似的，\n所以桃子本以为她能理解的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1071_p", "source_sha256": "f782ea6fcbb7ef683aa9d49f0c8aabdc56fe15b6d8ae38e10fdd1ecd1afdda10", "ja": "そうか。けど、皆はともかく俺に遠慮しなくていいよ。\n俺は桃子のプロデューサーなんだから。", "zh": "这样啊。不过，先不说大家，你不用顾虑我。\n毕竟我是桃子的制作人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1072_049mom", "source_sha256": "af8e8c2bc06ae0708416c1bd0a49edd748ffd2189b8a91280cc5f3660b96696c", "ja": "でもそれは、アイドルのお仕事の話でしょ？\n家のことは……。", "zh": "但那说的是偶像工作的事吧？  \n家里的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1073_p", "source_sha256": "30de743c8ffa4f13998104b40b03a31c768679c30cfb1d9d95c05e4e0dda9d40", "ja": "確かにアイドルの仕事は、\n桃子の一部かもしれないよ。けど……。", "zh": "偶像的工作确实可能是桃子的一部分。但是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1074_p", "source_sha256": "6b4e21a97d6fae84f51ddc9f3d02de6c852398129c8e6224a5b871ec17cc995c", "ja": "周防桃子っていう女の子は、皆の前で「アイドルの\n周防桃子」になるためにたくさん努力してる。だろ？", "zh": "周防桃子这个女孩子，为了在大家面前成为“偶像\n周防桃子”，付出了非常多的努力。对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1075_p", "source_sha256": "47123cc714bf2dd3794d8a985fe1fc8b07e63fc93eaf6fc626a33b95383ae958", "ja": "普段の桃子が、アイドルの桃子を作ってる。\nだから全然、関係なくはないよ。", "zh": "平时的桃子，造就了偶像桃子。所以这两者完全不是没有关系的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1076_049mom", "source_sha256": "f1b7862b2deec3ce89634903c67b92282c8e7a4de2715f11a1dd76ffaa5467c5", "ja": "お兄ちゃん。……桃子が子役でお仕事してたころ、\nいっぱいワガママ言ったって話したことあるでしょ。", "zh": "哥哥……之前跟你说过吧，桃子当童星工作的时候，提过很多任性的要求。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1077_049mom", "source_sha256": "66dfb65b8587387ff8d53cccd7cc0fa5561e89ef63053faf863afdafb144d6da", "ja": "桃子は女優だからね。イヤな子の演技なんて、\nすっごくカンタンだったよ。", "zh": "桃子可是演员嘛。演一个讨人嫌的孩子，\n简直太简单了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1078_049mom", "source_sha256": "b58d89d4c91313829b5ced8b6bb0f23e032571b5bb562892c6e37aeed99acc71", "ja": "お仕事するのにぜんぜん関係ないいやなこと、\nたくさん言ったから。みんなに嫌われてたと思う……。", "zh": "因为我说了很多和工作完全无关的难听话。我想大家应该都讨厌我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1079_p", "source_sha256": "7029b39881f385ba839cdcfd3991a773e4f499184744acba07a203469cf87c6e", "ja": "うん。……桃子は、どうしてそんな事したんだ？", "zh": "嗯。……桃子，你当时为什么要那么做呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1080_049mom", "source_sha256": "7240e6395bd4fe991a8d6169bba78de4127953e484b28b9a42e4b3bfd3b3c7f6", "ja": "それは……ワガママを言ってみんなを困らせたら、\nふたりが迎えに来てくれるんじゃないかって……。", "zh": "那是因为……桃子想着，要是任性地让大家为难，说不定两个人就会来接桃子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1081_049mom", "source_sha256": "ac4afb22ac430c51532f0883c629cb1ebe4763a7233c262be81247279715cd68", "ja": "で、でも！　ぜんぜんそんなことなかったし、\n桃子は芸能界を干されちゃったんだけどね。", "zh": "可、可是！完全没有那回事，桃子还被演艺圈封杀了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1082_049mom", "source_sha256": "4b0b3476bdafddd7c4c0103451c304a487339e4cb9c0776c162995607454ea6d", "ja": "だから、女優をやってたころの桃子は、\nすっごく子どもだったってこと。", "zh": "所以说，桃子当演员那会儿，真的是个小孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1083_p", "source_sha256": "400d770a5971c3c49c2e4f4be5285da090c89393adf3348df73b25c6950a66a9", "ja": "そうだな。\n桃子は小さかったし、今でも子どもだもんな。", "zh": "是啊。桃子那时候个子小，现在也还是个孩子嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1084_049mom", "source_sha256": "914e62861a2cfd7cd503dfb8a6a7d07dc181544c6a10a7b38da94bac66aa764d", "ja": "ちょっと、お兄ちゃん？", "zh": "等一下，哥哥？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1085_p", "source_sha256": "2f44d57dc09d5032de60662da65c53ff94bff5f3133cc6002000203e9344da0e", "ja": "だって、桃子が子どもなのは本当の事じゃないか。\nそれなのに、子どもにどちらか選ばせるのは、ずるい。", "zh": "可是，桃子还是个孩子，这不是事实吗？\n既然如此，还让孩子来选一个，太狡猾了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1086_049mom", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1087_p", "source_sha256": "8f14e79b2400a5b2b3dc559a832dfe843e34a212076e8f4b7303e93d4738907b", "ja": "桃子は子どもだけど、お父さんとお母さんは大人だ。\n……大人なんだから、自分達で決めるべきなんだ。", "zh": "桃子虽然是孩子，但爸爸和妈妈都是大人。\n……既然是大人，就应该由他们自己做决定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1088_p", "source_sha256": "c4130cb7658a845c8f257449893dbd7086bb4ea1f4d52fe2bfca9b1a90ea76c4", "ja": "だからお父さんとお母さんが元に戻らなくても、\nそれは桃子のせいじゃない。ふたりの責任なんだ。", "zh": "所以，就算爸爸和妈妈没能恢复原状，也不是桃子的错。那是他们两个人的责任。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1089_p", "source_sha256": "724d72be45e25674a0419ca4580f8910ad116013a608cd39dd6636e203cbd9ac", "ja": "選びたくない、選べない。どっちでもいいんだよ。\n桃子が思った事が、桃子にとっての正解なんだから。", "zh": "不想选，也没法选。选哪个都无所谓。桃子想到的事，对桃子来说就是正确答案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1091_p", "source_sha256": "02d64fd1b1cf28eef4d76b4fa416b37c657050411b51be9906ebadf7ca35311d", "ja": "10年ちょっとしか生きてないのに、ひとりで\nたくさん頑張ったんだな。えらいぞ、桃子。", "zh": "明明才活了10多年，却独自\n努力了这么久。桃子，你真了不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1092_049mom", "source_sha256": "b2912bd350b8841aea3b85a58959f940454526f4daa42fc680c62ae2ff2bd815", "ja": "う……うえっ、えっ。えーん、えーん……。", "zh": "呜……呜呜，呜哇……呜哇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1093_049mom", "source_sha256": "ea280f50caf979a8ea58e451c6c5e8a936727cd0f506852501a33dafb548a685", "ja": "お父さん……お母さん……。", "zh": "爸爸……妈妈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1094_p", "source_sha256": "3609357306b49e252217a7f38e4dc0c40604a8841e58341fab30f6312a290a13", "ja": "冷えてきたな。桃子、そろそろ中に入ろうか？\n帰るなら、送っていくし。", "zh": "天冷起来了。桃子，差不多该进去了吧？\n要回去的话，我送你回去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1095_049mom", "source_sha256": "616362ac56ceae75d741a5f0883841c3c6525715302a71427cda8e6d20dc8eb8", "ja": "今日はもう、帰る……。", "zh": "今天就先回去了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1096_p", "source_sha256": "3ed1f0808d19508f813d3b9a04f975eb08fefd40e29aa9821435cf401665e52c", "ja": "そうか。……なあ桃子、考えたんだけど。\nご両親を、今度の公演に呼んでみないか？", "zh": "这样啊。……那个，桃子，我想了想。\n要不要邀请你的父母来看下次的公演？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1097_p", "source_sha256": "88e51d67e7ffe1d18d70bb06f3ce1c8db41292638c30c866c4abd33074191211", "ja": "「ふたりで来てほしい」って。", "zh": "跟他们说“希望两个人能一起来”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1098_049mom", "source_sha256": "28c48fc05692e063843015c18b2ab481462e2b493c2f957ed4e98739b8f175db", "ja": "え……でも……。", "zh": "诶……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1099_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1100_049mom", "source_sha256": "0ed078dc2a979792b8a6cf46a528b345a26dbdfd9a696dd585cfb794d7bc1bbd", "ja": "どうせ来ないよ。お父さんも、お母さんも……。", "zh": "反正他们不会来的。爸爸和妈妈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1101_p", "source_sha256": "3bfdcd0255390c43a90435ba2b4cc43016c4e3f9db06d29deca84507275df301", "ja": "そうかもしれないけど……\n桃子の意思表示にはなるだろ？", "zh": "也许是这样……\n但这至少能表达桃子的心意吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1102_p", "source_sha256": "be9c7eebc8d41a79f975dc5734c1d7b9288c5244628af57fa4cdf8d5ad4e2cc9", "ja": "アイドルは、桃子がいま、一番頑張っている事なんだ。\nそれを観にくるくらいの事も、できないなんて……。", "zh": "偶像是桃子现在最努力在做的事情。\n连来看她的演出都做不到……ೇಕ", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1103_049mom", "source_sha256": "301675dc7b79237f1ead2ac530b19bbdfab8795d3596dfb98d9b2b958bd6365e", "ja": "ね、ねえ、お兄ちゃん。\n……もしかして、怒ってる？", "zh": "那、那个……哥哥。\n……难道你生气了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1104_p", "source_sha256": "5785f2dbe71249ee052c6b475670b440871b8a5660d3a76e9d31ee429d9ca60f", "ja": "そうだな。ご両親にも事情があるんだろうけど……\n桃子を巻き込む事に、俺は納得してないよ。", "zh": "是啊。你的父母应该也有他们的苦衷，不过……我不能接受把桃子牵扯进来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1105_p", "source_sha256": "3ef8a6f5c9a3112939481a5561f0ada58e5128edb1766e0596b652f3b04e3e73", "ja": "それに俺だけじゃないぞ。桃子の事を好きな人達は皆、\n桃子を傷つけられたら怒るんだ。覚えておいてくれ。", "zh": "而且不只是我。喜欢桃子的人，看到桃子受伤都会生气。你可要记住了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1106_049mom", "source_sha256": "3817fffaf9e1aeca55c45749963224117596de15f3e9f95d9d4808684ba7cd28", "ja": "そう……なんだ。みんなも、怒るんだ。\nふーん……。", "zh": "这样……啊。大家也会生气啊。\n哼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1107_p", "source_sha256": "e42f7a4ce0dc6360ab9ff1a1813af2bf0ca2a5b438e35da9b0716456da96d1f5", "ja": "なあ、桃子。\n今度の新曲、桃子にすごく似合ってると思う。", "zh": "那个，桃子。\n我觉得这次的新歌特别适合桃子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1108_p", "source_sha256": "1a18e4b500ccb021a570463e13517cf4ae6ef2516111d5feb5fb1e8abd850863", "ja": "『アイドル周防桃子』の、最高のステージを\nファンのみんなに見せてあげてほしい。……できるか？", "zh": "希望你能把身为“偶像周防桃子”的最佳舞台\n展现给各位粉丝。……办得到吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1109_049mom", "source_sha256": "15b3dc8d353fc7df1fad2e6289b2c2021cfb5cc55a9df697bcac8001d7c8a611", "ja": "……も、もう。仕方ないなぁ。", "zh": "……真是的，真拿你没办法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_082_1110_049mom", "source_sha256": "f9e09d98245c334d82736f1f28d7b35df6f650681536e9cd0484de121dba0923", "ja": "わかったよ。お兄ちゃんやファンのみんなに、\n桃子がとびっきりの夢を見せてあげるよ！", "zh": "我知道啦。桃子会让大哥哥和各位粉丝，\n看到最棒的梦想的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
